message: "If using this proof archive, please cite it."
title: "Unbounded Stabilizer Distance from Subdivisions of a Fixed 3-Connected Graph"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "We answer the unbounded-distance part of Ganguly Section VI problem 1 using subdivisions of K4 over F8. The realized stabilizer distance doubles at each subdivision stage. We do not classify rates or distances in general."
